eo/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo or manage the restaurant with friends online.</strong>   <br>‎‎‎‎</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎‎‎‎‎‎</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎‎‎‎‎‎<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/54762a1c17e663dd3e7186e272cb4491.webp?t=1772723228\" width=800 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/363f6a4af48cdaaa4603e89c3a33059e.poster.avif?t=1772723228\" width=618 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/363f6a4af48cdaaa4603e89c3a33059e.webm?t=1772723228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/363f6a4af48cdaaa4603e89c3a33059e.mp4?t=1772723228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎<strong>Expand your pizzeria with freshly baked pastries!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy unbaked croissants and more, bake them in the oven, and serve your hungry customers delicious warm pastries straight from your kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎‎‎‎‎</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎‎‎</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/0c2858c8d8a63adf648858e46cac56e1.webp?t=1772723228\" width=800 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/e132d263b1ef5bd25fe470ad068d1f8d.poster.avif?t=1772723228\" width=618 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/e132d263b1ef5bd25fe470ad068d1f8d.webm?t=1772723228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/e132d263b1ef5bd25fe470ad068d1f8d.mp4?t=1772723228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎‎‎‎<strong>‎Upgrade your kitchen and restaurant visually by unlocking stylish new decorations, layouts, and furniture.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p>",
